ther community mappings remain unresolved.","modelId":"tesu-general-management","optionIds":[],"owner":"research","programIds":["tesu-general-management"],"requirementIds":[],"scope":"program","sourceIds":[],"sourceReferenceIds":[]},{"blocking":true,"category":"missing-research","code":"unresolved-research","factIds":[],"field":null,"id":"tesu-general-management:unresolved-research:8c219aa7f277543b","message":"Community-reported options outside the five independently school-submitted Sophia receiving maps still need current course/version, source recommendation period, receiving level and catalog research. The five documented named matches retain separate provisional-provider and personal-record conditions.","modelId":"tesu-general-management","optionIds":[],"owner":"research","programIds":["tesu-general-management"],"requirementIds":[],"scope":"program","sourceIds":[],"sourceReferenceIds":[]},{"blocking":true,"category":"missing-research","code":"unresolved-research","factIds":[],"field":null,"id":"tesu-general-management:unresolved-research:9f64358a833dda0d","message":"Study.com Accounting 302 has inconsistent reported titles across community pages. Confirm the exact current course and its ACC-4010 upper-level award, rather than inferring it from “Advanced Accounting.”","modelId":"tesu-general-management","optionIds":[],"owner":"research","programIds":["tesu-general-management"],"requirementIds":[],"scope":"program","sourceIds":[],"sourceReferenceIds":[]},{"blocking":true,"category":"missing-research","code":"unresolved-research","factIds":[],"field":null,"id":"tesu-general-management:unresolved-research:b69d50baa260e85c","message":"Study.com Business 308 SDCM-0054 v6 recommendation dates were not recovered. Business 306 SDCM-0071 v5 is dated June 1, 2026 through May 31, 2029; TESU must still confirm version, awarded level and individual catalog applicability.","modelId":"tesu-general-management","optionIds":[],"owner":"research","programIds":["tesu-general-management"],"requirementIds":[],"scope":"program","sourceIds":[],"sourceReferenceIds":[]},{"blocking":true,"category":"missing-research","code":"unresolved-research","factIds":[],"field":null,"id":"tesu-general-management:unresolved-research:c1b28ccabac5b47f","message":"No exact current outside mapping was established for ETH-2200 or BUS-2100. FIN-3010 has conflicting Study.com credit claims and remains unresolved. The featured SOC-2100 and FIL-1100 Human Cultures choices remain research gaps; other approved category choices may fit. MAN-3720 and MAN-3310 now have provider-published conditional candidates, not individual TESU approvals.","modelId":"tesu-general-management","optionIds":[],"owner":"research","programIds":["tesu-general-management"],"requirementIds":[],"scope":"program","sourceIds":[],"sourceReferenceIds":[]},{"blocking":true,"category":"missing-research","code":"unresolved-research","factIds":[],"field":null,"id":"tesu-general-management:unresolved-research:d3d66108bc891827","message":"Scientific Knowledge category replacements BIO-1010 and NUT-1010 need written current-catalog allocation approval; the community roadmap alone does not certify their placement in this individual degree.","modelId":"tesu-general-management","optionIds":[],"owner":"research","programIds":["tesu-general-management"],"requirementIds":[],"scope":"program","sourceIds":[],"sourceReferenceIds":[]},{"blocking":true,"category":"missing-research","code":"unresolved-research","factIds":[],"field":null,"id":"tesu-general-management:unresolved-research:d9a7bc26244cdfae","message":"Prerequisites, future course offerings, official evaluation and personal catalog eligibility remain to be confirmed.","modelId":"tesu-general-management","optionIds":[],"owner":"research","programIds":["tesu-general-management"],"requirementIds":[],"scope":"program","sourceIds":[],"sourceReferenceIds":[]}],"requirements":[],"schemaVersion":1,"sourceReferences":[],"sources":[]}
